  "worked_solution": "To find the length, we read the values that correspond to the points $A$ and $B$ and take the difference.\n\nFrom the diagram, we see that $A$ corresponds to $-12$ units while $B$ corresponds to $-5$ units.\n\nTherefore, we conclude that \n\n$$\nAB=-5-(-12)=7\\,\\text{units}.\n$$",
